 home from work when a woman approaches him to ask for a ride to a nearby city. The city is in the same direction as his house but it&#39;s 10 miles further than he planned to go.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Cameron is filling up his car at a gas station on his way home from work when a woman approaches...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 16px;\">Heinz's wife has recently fallen ill and needs an expensive medication that is not covered by her medical insurance. They don't have the money needed to purchase the expensive prescription, but they know that it's vital for her to have it if she is going to recover.<\/span><br><\/p>","DataExportTag":"C4-Scenario5 ","QuestionID":"QID919"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_74lfKBubMMSg194","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID920","SecondaryAttribute":"Here are some things Cameron could do, as suggested by Chat-GPT: \u00a0${e:\/\/Field\/C4S5_Response}","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Here are some things Cameron could do, as suggested by Chat-GPT:<\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;${e:\/\/Field\/C4S5_Response}<\/span><\/span><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Here are some things Cameron could do, as suggested by Chat-GPT: \u00a0${e:\/\/Field\/C4S5_Response}","ChoiceOrder":[],"Valid